#   ollama show qwen3-vl-abliterated:8b-q8_0        # capabilities must list: vision
#
# If `ollama show` does NOT list vision (a known GGUF-import quirk), fall back to
# the packaged build, which the watcher already prefers next:
#   ollama pull huihui_ai/qwen3-vl-abliterated:8b-instruct-q8_0

